* analog_top -- the analog macro of the 8-bit true bottom-plate single-slope ADC:
* four sampling/conversion cells on one shared ramp_simple, bias_gen, one
* midref_div and two midref_buf.
*
* GENERATED from analog_top.sch by schematic.sh (xschem, hierarchical: every
* block down to transistors, as drawn). DO NOT HAND-EDIT. Change the drawings
* (analog_top_sch.py, the blocks' own .sch) and rewrite this file with
*   ./scripts/sim.sh analog-top PHASES=schematic REGEN=1
* Without REGEN the schematic phase FAILs while this file differs from what
* the drawings netlist to.
*
* Subcircuits: analog_top, atop_cell, bias_gen, midref_div, midref_buf,
* ramp_simple, comparator, tspc_dff, sw_s0, sw_s1, sw_s2. comparator,
* tspc_dff and sw_s0/1/2 carry drawn S/D junction geometry (the PDK MOS
* symbols' ad/as/pd/ps/nrd/nrs; the switches' from their deck).
* No model or parameter card: the including deck carries the PDK models
* (typical / res_typical / mimcap_typical) and
* ../ramp_gen/data/ramp_simple_params.spice ({RS_*}).
* The hand-written contract this replaced (2026-10-08) is kept unchanged in
* trannoise/ref_decks/analog_top.spice.
*
** sch_path: /foss/designs/mixed_signal/vrlo_ref/macro/ref_analog_top/analog_top.sch
.subckt analog_top vin vrlo ramp_rst cnt_clk s0_0 s0_1 s0_2 s0_3 s1_0 s1_1 s1_2 s1_3 s2_0 s2_1 s2_2 s2_3 q0 q1 q2 q3 avdd avss
+ dvdd dvss
*.PININFO vin:I vrlo:I ramp_rst:I cnt_clk:I s0_0:I s0_1:I s0_2:I s0_3:I s1_0:I s1_1:I s1_2:I s1_3:I s2_0:I s2_1:I s2_2:I s2_3:I
*+ q0:O q1:O q2:O q3:O avdd:B avss:B dvdd:B dvss:B
VMBG avdd avdd_bg 0
VMREF avdd avdd_ref 0
VMRAMP avdd avdd_ramp 0
VMC0 avdd avdd_c0 0
VMC1 avdd avdd_c1 0
VMC2 avdd avdd_c2 0
VMC3 avdd avdd_c3 0
XBG avdd_bg avss pbias0 pbias1 pbias2 pbias3 pbias_r ivref ivbl bias_gen
XDIV vmid avdd_ref avss midref_div
XVREF vref vmid ivref avdd_ref avss midref_buf
XVBL vbl vmid ivbl avdd_ref avss midref_buf
XRD pbias_r pbias_r avdd_ramp avdd_ramp pfet_03v3 L=1u W=20u nf=10
XRAMP vramp ramp_rst vrlo pbias_r avdd_ramp avss ramp_simple
XC0 vin vramp s0_0 s1_0 s2_0 vref vbl pbias0 q0 cnt_clk avdd_c0 avss dvdd dvss atop_cell
XC1 vin vramp s0_1 s1_1 s2_1 vref vbl pbias1 q1 cnt_clk avdd_c1 avss dvdd dvss atop_cell
XC2 vin vramp s0_2 s1_2 s2_2 vref vbl pbias2 q2 cnt_clk avdd_c2 avss dvdd dvss atop_cell
XC3 vin vramp s0_3 s1_3 s2_3 vref vbl pbias3 q3 cnt_clk avdd_c3 avss dvdd dvss atop_cell
.ends

